<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Menem to make Southeast Asian tour.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Menem to make Southeast Asian tour.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's President Carlos Menem will visit Vietnam, Thailand and Singapore in February, the Foreign Ministry said.</p>
<p>Accompanied by Foreign Minister Guido Di Tella and by a delegation of businessmen, Menem will visit Vietnam from February 16-18. He will be in Thailand from February 18-20 before moving on to Singapore.</p>
<p>Menem's agenda has still to be announced. The visit will follow up another Asian trade offensive last year, when he visited Indonesia and Malaysia.</p>
<p>((--Ariel Said, Buenos Aires Newsroom +54 1 318-0633))</p>
